0.22.2 -> 0.23.0 : modular habitat/corridor architecture; all ten habitats split into outer and inner builders under the shared StructureModule access contract; explicit per-structure walkable deck heights drive POV and corridor docking stairs; mixed shell/glazing/foundation containment fixes Bio Dome/Cantine interior classification; corridor outer pressure shell and inner walk deck are instantiated through CorridorModule.
0.23.0 -> 0.30.0 : baseline release; filled/detail-enhanced rendering across every habitat, corridor, resource structure, supply channel and walkway; shared future-hardware detail passes; reinforced airtight corridor docking with redundant seals and hard dead-end bulkheads; Air-Lock-only exterior pressure-network access; realistic smoothed POV acceleration/stair motion; canonical astronaut scale reduced to 80%; clean build reports final executable size in KB/bytes.
